  "Question": "In which of the following situations is the shadow formed by parallel projection?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "A shadow under a streetlight",
    "B": "A shadow under a desk lamp",
    "C": "A shadow in sunlight",
    "D": "A shadow formed by a flashlight"
