  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The Sun is very far from Earth, so sunlight can be approximated as parallel rays, forming parallel projection. Light from lamps and flashlights originates from a single point, producing central projection.",
